Ken Williams <ken@mathforum.org>

Most of the code here was written by Randy W. Sims <RandyS@ThePierianSpring.org>.

=head1 SEE ALSO

perl(1), ExtUtils::CBuilder(3), ExtUtils::MakeMaker(3)

